limlua: lua 5.4.9 with 0-indexing, { } blocks and c-style syntax.

  if x != 0 && ok { }        // comments, /* nested */
  for i = 0; i < n; i++ { }  continue / break name
  x += 1   len(t)   rawlen(t)

build:  make posix
test:   tests/run.sh
run:    src/limlua file.lim

changes from lua: git diff lua-5.4.9
